# The build context of the images infra/pipeline/images.json lists (apps/id/Dockerfile, mcps/Dockerfile, infra/ops/Dockerfile): the repository root.
# The images carry sources, manifests and build output only: no environment file, test, coverage, git metadata or local install.
# The last matching line wins, so the workspace lines come first and the exclusions that apply everywhere last.

# Workspaces no image runs: only their package.json, which the frozen install reads with the lockfile.
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
apps/community-mcp
packages/acceptance/*
!packages/acceptance/package.json
scripts/*
!scripts/package.json
infra/**
!infra/*/package.json
# The ops image's sources.
!infra/ops/src

.git
.github
.claude
.env*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/__tests__
**/*.md
**/*.mdx
docs
reports
charts
infra/ops/src/testing.ts
